---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Delivery Policy · Blu Baby Show" description="How Blu Shop digital downloads are delivered. Nothing is shipped.">
  <section class="section legal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Blu Baby Show</p>
      <h1>Delivery &amp; Shipping Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: 15 November 2026</p>

      <h2>Nothing is shipped</h2>
      <p>All Blu Shop products are <strong>digital downloads (PDF soft copies)</strong>. We do not ship any physical items,
        so there are no shipping charges and no delivery address is needed.</p>

      <h2>How you get your file</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>You pay securely through Dodo Payments (UPI, RuPay, cards or wallets).</li>
        <li>Straight after payment, you see a download link on screen.</li>
        <li>You also get the download link by email, at the address you gave at checkout.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>Delivery is usually <strong>instant</strong>, and always within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</p>

      <h2>Opening and printing</h2>
      <p>The files are standard PDFs. They open on any phone, tablet or computer, and print on A4 or US Letter paper,
        at home or at any print shop.</p>

      <h2>Didn't get it?</h2>
      <p>Check your spam or promotions folder first. If it isn't there, email
        <a href="mailto:blubabyshow@gmail.com">blubabyshow@gmail.com</a> with your order email and we will resend it.
        If we can't deliver it, you get a full refund (see our <a href="/refund">Refund Policy</a>).</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { padding-top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 2rem); max-width: 720px; }
  .legal h1 { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--blu-deep); }
  .legal ol { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .legal li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .legal a { color: var(--blu-d); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
